{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f61f5829726fafdbed415d484da53b24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am looking for any help you may have for a great photographer in Punta Cana .. that is reasonably priced .. and when i say that .. i mean. . no more than $2000 for a decent package (7+ hours of coverage) .. i feel like when looking at the prices of photographers my budget is low .. but considering my wedding is costing $3000 alone .. i don&#039;t have much room left for the photographers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am from Canada, and I hate that all these prices are in USD!! It kills me .. are there any photographers, other than Photo Phil, that charge in CAD??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love Karina Jensen&#039;s style .. her prices aren&#039;t too bad .. but i just wanted to check and see if any brides found someone with the same style, but less $$&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902013,"PostDate":1438872915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Brides!<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for any help you may have for a great photographer in Punta Cana .. that is reasonably priced .. and when i say that .. i mean. . no more than $2000 for a decent package (7+ hours of coverage) .. i feel like when looking at the prices of photographers my budget is low .. but considering my wedding is costing $3000 alone .. i don't have much room left for the photographers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am from Canada, and I hate that all these prices are in USD!! It kills me .. are there any photographers, other than Photo Phil, that charge in CAD??<\/p>\n<p>I love Karina Jensen's style .. her prices aren't too bad .. but i just wanted to check and see if any brides found someone with the same style, but less $$<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ton_03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430231376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsVanthof","Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.58.161.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"baab72941cb1db62e712a17de0627b34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking for a photographer too. I really love Katya Nova&#039;s style but I have a feeling they are going to be expensive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902373,"PostDate":1439406366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm looking for a photographer too. I really love Katya Nova's style but I have a feeling they are going to be expensive.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanebrittany@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.58.161.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439405045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284386.jpg?_r=1439406164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lilpartyrocker","Id":284386,"Name":"lilpartyrocker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.115.29.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3da3cf97c9f6f50ee605cb4cf9525f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m also looking but finding it hard to stay within budget.. especially with an outside vendor fee of $300!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Katya Nova is amazing! ..but very high and WAY over what I can afford.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stacey&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902461,"PostDate":1439495491,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm also looking but finding it hard to stay within budget.. especially with an outside vendor fee of $300!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Katya Nova is amazing! ..but very high and WAY over what I can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stacey<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"StaceyBialek11@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"74.138.180.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1377595901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272956.jpg?_r=1439495518","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacer11","Id":272956,"Name":"Stacer11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.222.240.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46e99e232c073e67837fed4204af287d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I recommend Sasha Chou Photoraphy. A very talented and friendly photographer. She loves to tavel. I am sure you can discuss good rate with her. Check out her photo. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A more affordable way to spend destination wedding is hiring a local vacation photographer instead. You save a lot on travel expenses, hotel expenses and have a LOCAL photogapher to show you around. Check out PicVoyage. A new vacation photography service company. &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com&lt;\/a&gt; which offers family photos, honeymoon, engagement, elopement and intimate destination photo service. The package is really affordable comapring to a destination wedding photographer. They can also offer local vaaction photo tours experience. I think it is pretty cool idea to save money and also get to tour the city.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902600,"PostDate":1439704895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I recommend Sasha Chou Photoraphy. A very talented and friendly photographer. She loves to tavel. I am sure you can discuss good rate with her. Check out her photo. <a href='http:\/\/sashachouphotography.tumblr.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/sashachouphot...phy.tumblr.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A more affordable way to spend destination wedding is hiring a local vacation photographer instead. You save a lot on travel expenses, hotel expenses and have a LOCAL photogapher to show you around. Check out PicVoyage. A new vacation photography service company. <a href='http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.picvoyage.com<\/a> which offers family photos, honeymoon, engagement, elopement and intimate destination photo service. The package is really affordable comapring to a destination wedding photographer. They can also offer local vaaction photo tours experience. I think it is pretty cool idea to save money and also get to tour the city.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"constancewu0168@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.222.240.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439702683,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"constancewu","Id":284439,"Name":"constancewu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e120aa7d7ed239b9ef56546ff6d42800","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey ladies :) I ended up booking with Karina Jensen. Her work is amazing and i am so happy to have her booked to capture our special day :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hear ya, my vendor fee is $500 :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;and I agree, Katya Nova work is also amazing, but a little out of my budget as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903319,"PostDate":1440527572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I ended up booking with Karina Jensen. Her work is amazing and i am so happy to have her booked to capture our special day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hear ya, my vendor fee is $500 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and I agree, Katya Nova work is also amazing, but a little out of my budget as well!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ton_03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430231376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsVanthof","Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9653e048cb224ac081f972c5a19b96e7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This was a bride that got married in April in Punta Cana. I have no idea what her cost was but her photos are stunning and she used HDC Photography. Plus her vendor fee was even higher than what you&#039;ve been quoted so her thread is probably worth a look.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903339,"PostDate":1440533561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78626-kcole123-planning-thread-april-17-2015-melia-caribe-tropical\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...aribe-tropical\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This was a bride that got married in April in Punta Cana. I have no idea what her cost was but her photos are stunning and she used HDC Photography. Plus her vendor fee was even higher than what you've been quoted so her thread is probably worth a look.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.100.184.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7788c796ae6c8e74d5e65081a5aa5579","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsVanthof\" post=\"1903319\" timestamp=\"1440527572\"]\nHey ladies :) I ended up booking with Karina Jensen. Her work is amazing and i am so happy to have her booked to capture our special day :)\n\nI hear ya, my vendor fee is $500 :(\n\nand I agree, Katya Nova work is also amazing, but a little out of my budget as well![\/quote]\nI agree with you that she works very professionally\n\nif your butget&#039;s okay, it&#039;s a well choice","Attachments":[],"Id":1904153,"PostDate":1441357118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsVanthof, on 25 August 2015 - 10:32 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I ended up booking with Karina Jensen. Her work is amazing and i am so happy to have her booked to capture our special day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hear ya, my vendor fee is $500 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and I agree, Katya Nova work is also amazing, but a little out of my budget as well!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree with you that she works very professionally<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>if your butget's okay, it's a well choice<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:rgb(62,62,62);font-family:Tahoma, Calibri, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);\">Online updates fastest score at\u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/u99bet.net\/ca-do-bong-da-online-ca-cuoc-the-thao-truc-tuyen\/'>7m<\/a>","Email":"levdung.exc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.100.178.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439179240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284343.jpg?_r=1439179533","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"excpomelo","Id":284343,"Name":"excpomelo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.249.156.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3caa66c6594338aa03f9920ff0283d39","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola! Making decisions can be difficult...&lt;span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(106,106,106);font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;I truly recommend the Weddingroll Cinematography &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;&#039;&gt;http:\/\/weddingroll.eu&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Wedding-Videography-Punta-Cana\/700933610011102?fref=ts&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Wedding-Videography-Punta-Cana\/700933610011102?fref=ts&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Their works are fabolous and there is a photo+video package.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904217,"PostDate":1441528658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola! Making decisions can be difficult...<span  style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(106,106,106);font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:small\">\u00a0<\/span>I truly recommend the Weddingroll Cinematography <a href='' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/weddingroll.eu\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/Wedding-Videography-Punta-Cana\/700933610011102?fref=ts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...0011102?fref=ts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Their works are fabolous and there is a photo+video package.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Xx<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.davis@euromail.hu","IpAddress":"92.249.156.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441527647,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284694.jpg?_r=1442516175","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"amanda8899","Id":284694,"Name":"amanda8899","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.0.108.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67e7ee60304e49c5ff4da6ad32c9d15c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh yes, decisions can be difficult. I got married last february at Dreams and did tons of research before finding my photographers. As a professional photo editor, I really wanted the wedding photos to be special and one thing I know is that you usually get what you pay for. One advice is do not scrimp on your photography budget. The photos are the lasting memories of the day and most of cheap photographers will just shoot and burn, giving you flat, dull, unedited photographs .Of course it all depends what you are looking for and how much photography is important to you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found Photo Souvenir ( you can find them in the vendor reviews) at the last minute and begged Renaud and Severine to commit to shooting our wedding.&amp;nbsp; They were clearly the best wedding photographers in Punta Cana, by a long shot. I also liked Katya Nova&#039;s work and Karina Jensen but&amp;nbsp; Severine and Renaud&#039;s work had it all for me with a perfect combination of lightning\/composition\/storytelling\/creativity\/pricing. Photographers like them in New York would cost at least 5000 US so their rates are very good for what they do and&amp;nbsp; you might consider the option if it is in your budget range. I personally had the best experience and my photos are outstanding ( and I am very hard to please!). I will place a full review soon and I hope it helps.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907869,"PostDate":1448466297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh yes, decisions can be difficult. I got married last february at Dreams and did tons of research before finding my photographers. As a professional photo editor, I really wanted the wedding photos to be special and one thing I know is that you usually get what you pay for. One advice is do not scrimp on your photography budget. The photos are the lasting memories of the day and most of cheap photographers will just shoot and burn, giving you flat, dull, unedited photographs .Of course it all depends what you are looking for and how much photography is important to you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found Photo Souvenir ( you can find them in the vendor reviews) at the last minute and begged Renaud and Severine to commit to shooting our wedding.\u00a0 They were clearly the best wedding photographers in Punta Cana, by a long shot. I also liked Katya Nova's work and Karina Jensen but\u00a0 Severine and Renaud's work had it all for me with a perfect combination of lightning\/composition\/storytelling\/creativity\/pricing. Photographers like them in New York would cost at least 5000 US so their rates are very good for what they do and\u00a0 you might consider the option if it is in your budget range. I personally had the best experience and my photos are outstanding ( and I am very hard to please!). I will place a full review soon and I hope it helps.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielafranklin@outlook.com","IpAddress":"190.167.102.203","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400797457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielaf","Id":278083,"Name":"danielaf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"5.69.209.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79472,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9c1062afc91b9c3d8cbee55cf80fa83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Hello,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just noticed on facebook that my awesome photographers Severine and Renaud (Photo Souvenir Punta Cana) are running a very generous giveaway till March 15 (you can win a full wedding coverage for your wedding!!!).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I thought I should let all the brides know since it is a huge opportunity and they are the best! Just check their blog&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/photosouvenirpuntacanawedding.com\/2016-2017-giveaway\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/photosouvenirpuntacanawedding.com\/2016-2017-giveaway\/&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Maybe it will help one of you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Daniela&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px;\"&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911678,"PostDate":1457538005,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span>Hello,<\/span><\/p>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>I just noticed on facebook that my awesome photographers Severine and Renaud (Photo Souvenir Punta Cana) are running a very generous giveaway till March 15 (you can win a full wedding coverage for your wedding!!!).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought I should let all the brides know since it is a huge opportunity and they are the best! Just check their blog\u00a0<br><a href='http:\/\/photosouvenirpuntacanawedding.com\/2016-2017-giveaway\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/photosouvenir...-2017-giveaway\/<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Maybe it will help one of you!<\/p>\n<div>\n<div  style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><span>Daniela<\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:15px\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"danielafranklin@outlook.com","IpAddress":"190.167.102.203","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400797457,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielaf","Id":278083,"Name":"danielaf","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
