{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.11","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79897,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1260c2ae10fe676446e9898a726cfb25","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone done the free package at Dreams Palm Beach? I am considering it for my wedding in 2017 as we cannot afford to spend too much. We are planning on having a very small wedding, hopefully under 20 ppl. I read on the website you can have the dinner at one of the restaurants if you have under 15 ppl, does anyone know if that has a cost?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also we would still like to have some sort of a reception so we can have a dance and the free package does not include that. Does anyone know how much it would be to add that?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any other advice from people who have gotten married at this resort would be appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know its a gorgeous resort, as we were there in Dec and that&#039;s where we got engaged! Really hoping to be able to get married there too!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910127,"PostDate":1453920726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone done the free package at Dreams Palm Beach? I am considering it for my wedding in 2017 as we cannot afford to spend too much. We are planning on having a very small wedding, hopefully under 20 ppl. I read on the website you can have the dinner at one of the restaurants if you have under 15 ppl, does anyone know if that has a cost?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also we would still like to have some sort of a reception so we can have a dance and the free package does not include that. Does anyone know how much it would be to add that?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any other advice from people who have gotten married at this resort would be appreciated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know its a gorgeous resort, as we were there in Dec and that's where we got engaged! Really hoping to be able to get married there too!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"queen_tiffany2003@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.230.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453845308,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Queentiff","Id":286058,"Name":"Queentiff","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.95.180.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79897,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ed6882f87b4869449c047072f1f12b0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello and congratulations on your engagement! I am one of the BDW TA&#039;s and have been to Dreams Palm Beach several times and just stayed there this past November. Typically if you set up an event in one of the restaurants and it is not a private event there is not a charge. I have the resort fact sheet, wedding guide etc.. and will be happy to email those to you and answer any resort questions you may have. You can contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910178,"PostDate":1454016942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello and congratulations on your engagement! I am one of the BDW TA's and have been to Dreams Palm Beach several times and just stayed there this past November. Typically if you set up an event in one of the restaurants and it is not a private event there is not a charge. I have the resort fact sheet, wedding guide etc.. and will be happy to email those to you and answer any resort questions you may have. You can contact me at patty@wrighttravelagency.com. Thanks! TA Patty<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.17.40.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79897,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3298e2a04dc281277332ae3c6c99fe1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married at Dreams La Romana .&amp;nbsp; Since its the same company I&#039;m assuming the prices are around the same and the costs&amp;nbsp;I was&amp;nbsp;given were:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ Regular service (4hrs) - from $350&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ Premium with special lights and MC (4hrs) - from $900&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;LED dance floor 12x12 - From $450&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Parquet dance floor 10x10 - from 350, 15x15 - From $450&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;speakers and set up for ipod for your own music - From $150&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dinner for reception - I have no clue if they will allow you to do a dinner reservation for under 15 or if it cost.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910616,"PostDate":1454958297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married at Dreams La Romana .\u00a0 Since its the same company I'm assuming the prices are around the same and the costs\u00a0I was\u00a0given were:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>DJ Regular service (4hrs) - from $350<\/p>\n<p>DJ Premium with special lights and MC (4hrs) - from $900<\/p>\n<p>LED dance floor 12x12 - From $450<\/p>\n<p>Parquet dance floor 10x10 - from 350, 15x15 - From $450<\/p>\n<p>speakers and set up for ipod for your own music - From $150<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Dinner for reception - I have no clue if they will allow you to do a dinner reservation for under 15 or if it cost.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megewy@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.17.41.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437863279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MegLeLy","Id":284131,"Name":"MegLeLy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
